  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tomato chutney is a rich, savoury preserve that sits well alongside sausages, cold pork, a fried egg, or sharp cheese. The tomatoes need to be ripe,  under-ripe tomatoes give a thin, acidic result,  and the cooking is a long, gentle reduction until thick and dark. Makes about four 300 g jars."
          }
        ]
      },
